                         "name":"elysia dialogue",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"[\"Oh, it's you.\", \"This is just a precaution before you venture out on the outskirts of the city.\", \"In front of you is a bug the guild members caught.\", \"I want you to test it for a debugging battle, and prove that you are capable of handling them.\", \"Good luck.\"]"
